# Documentation

- `docs/BUSINESS_INFO.md` — confirmed facts only; never fill gaps from OTA scrapes without labelling them Unverified
- `docs/CHANGELOG.md` — record why, not only what
- Sitemap lives in `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`; pricing schema lives in `docs/DATABASE.md`; do not split those into extra files
- Do not add `PROJECT_CONTEXT.md`, `SITE_STRUCTURE.md`, or `ROOM_PRICING.md` — that content already belongs in `START_HERE.md` / `ARCHITECTURE.md` / `DATABASE.md`
